# Optional Google Maps JavaScript map. The React app keeps its open map
# unless BOTH values are provided at build time. Use a billed Google Cloud
# project, restrict the browser key to your domains and Maps JavaScript API,
# and create a production map ID. No Google Places data is copied into the
# catalogue. Review Google Maps Platform terms for your directory use case.
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-restricted-browser-key
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID=your-map-id
